  - displayStartTime: 54.001
    displayEndTime: 55.309
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Let''s go, gamers!'
  - displayStartTime: 58.631
    displayEndTime: 59.835
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: What is this?'
  - displayStartTime: 62.214
    displayEndTime: 63.28
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Yikes.'
  - displayStartTime: 64.879
    displayEndTime: 65.703
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Have a good one.'
  - displayStartTime: 75.358
    displayEndTime: 78.673
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: <style="Subtitles_Format_()">Muffled</style>
      And on Sunday, it''s gonna be a snow day.'
  - displayStartTime: 78.674
    displayEndTime: 82.127
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: <style="Subtitles_Format_()">Muffled</style>
      And that''s the weather, with Rumble Tumble.'
  - displayStartTime: 83.289
    displayEndTime: 85.081
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: <style="Subtitles_Format_()">Muffled</style>
      Get us out of here, get us out-'
  - displayStartTime: 85.081
    displayEndTime: 87.081
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: <style="Subtitles_Format_()">Muffled</style>
      How close is the storm?!'
  - displayStartTime: 87.081
    displayEndTime: 89.081
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: <style="Subtitles_Format_()">Muffled</style>
      How close is the sto- Get us-'
  - displayStartTime: 96.624
    displayEndTime: 98.624
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: My favorite sauce is water.'
  - displayStartTime: 100.444
    displayEndTime: 102
    text: '<style="Subtitles_Person_RT">RT</style>: Sorry, that''s hard to do.'
